{
  "name": "@atl/api",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "ATL platform Lambda functions (atl-api, atl-public, atl-agent, atl-checks, atl-lifecycle, atl-timer, atl-reaper, atl-certs, atl-pricing, atl-custom-resources, atl-copy-artifacts, atl-tagger), AWS adapters behind the shared ports, and the ATL_DEV_MODE=1 dev runtime (DynamoDB Local, in-process orchestrator, local runner).",
